#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py:369
msgid ""
"Package not available in the enabled repositories. It may come from the AUR, belong to a disabled repository (such as multilib), or the package database may be outdated.\n"
"Suggestion: Update the whole system with 'sudo pacman -Syu' and try again."
msgstr ""
"Pakett ei ole saadaval lubatud hoidlates. See võib pärineda AUR-ist, kuuluda keelatud hoidlasse (nt multilib) või olla pakettide andmebaas aegunud.  \n"
"Soovitus: Uuendage kogu süsteemi käsuga 'sudo pacman -Syu' ja proovige uuesti."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py:379
msgid ""
"A conflict prevented the operation from completing.\n"
"Suggestion: Clean the cache and update with 'sudo pacman -Scc' followed by 'sudo pacman -Syyu'."
msgstr ""
"Konflikt takistas operatsiooni lõpetamist.\n"
"Soovitus: Puhasta vahemälu ja uuenda käsuga 'sudo pacman -Scc', seejärel 'sudo pacman -Syyu'."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py:387
msgid ""
"Some files from this package already exist on the system.\n"
"Suggestion: Check which package owns the file with 'pacman -Qo <file_path>' and resolve the conflict."
msgstr ""
"Mõned selle paketi failid on süsteemis juba olemas.\n"
"Soovitus: Kontrolli, millise paketi alla fail kuulub käsuga 'pacman -Qo <file_path>' ja lahenda konflikt."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py:395
msgid ""
"Required dependencies could not be resolved.\n"
"Suggestion: Update the full system first with 'sudo pacman -Syu'."
msgstr ""
"Nõutud sõltuvusi ei õnnestunud lahendada.\n"
"Soovitus: Uuenda esmalt kogu süsteem käsuga 'sudo pacman -Syu'."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py:402
msgid ""
"Package signature could not be verified.\n"
"Suggestion: Update your keyrings with 'sudo pacman -S archlinux-keyring manjaro-keyring'."
msgstr ""
"Paketi allkirja ei õnnestunud kontrollida.\n"
"Soovitus: Uuenda oma võtmehoidlaid käsuga 'sudo pacman -S archlinux-keyring manjaro-keyring'."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py:410
msgid ""
"The package database is locked by another process.\n"
"If no other package manager is running, remove the lock with 'sudo rm /var/lib/pacman/db.lck'."
msgstr ""
"Pakettandmebaas on lukustatud teise protsessi poolt.\n"
"Kui ükski teine pakettide haldur ei tööta, eemalda lukustus käsuga 'sudo rm /var/lib/pacman/db.lck'."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py:418
msgid ""
"Not enough disk space to complete the operation.\n"
"Suggestion: Free space by clearing the package cache with 'sudo pacman -Scc'."
msgstr ""
"Ei ole piisavalt kettaruumi toimingu lõpetamiseks.\n"
"Soovitus: Vabasta ruumi, tühjendades pakettide vahemälu käsuga 'sudo pacman -Scc'."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py:426
msgid ""
"Could not download required files.\n"
"Suggestion: Check your internet connection. If the problem persists, try updating your mirror list."
msgstr ""
"Nõutud faile ei saanud alla laadida.\n"
"Soovitus: Kontrolli oma internetiühendust. Kui probleem püsib, proovi värskendada oma peegellisti."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py:434
msgid ""
"A downloaded package is corrupted.\n"
"Suggestion: Clear the cache with 'sudo pacman -Scc' and try again."
msgstr ""
"Laaditud pakett on rikutud.\n"
"Soovitus: Tühjenda vahemälu käsuga 'sudo pacman -Scc' ja proovi uuesti."

